// Friendship stories you live through (Phase 8, step 5). Every visit keeps its original lines and grows into a short
// scene: pre lines set the place and what's in the way, add lines give the moment after. Arcs cross paths with other
// regulars, and about a third take a harder turn. ARCX[id][part] = { pre, add }; applied once by friends.js.
// Loop: drive the city -> stop by a regular -> choose -> the city remembers (flags read in later visits and by other
// regulars) -> friendship rewards (rp, loot, the cast book).

